<h1 style="font-size:clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4rem)">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1><p class="note">Last updated 1 September 2026</p>
<h3>1. Bookings</h3><p>Bookings are confirmed on screen once you complete the booking form. Please arrive five minutes early. Appointment lengths are estimates and may vary slightly.</p>
<h3>2. Cancellations and rescheduling</h3><p>Please cancel or reschedule at least 24 hours ahead by phone or email so we can offer the slot to someone else. Repeated no-shows may result in a deposit being required for future bookings.</p>
<h3>3. Late arrivals</h3><p>If you are more than 15 minutes late we may need to shorten your service or rebook you, depending on the next appointment.</p>
<h3>4. Prices and payment</h3><p>Prices are in South African rand, include VAT and are paid in the shop by card or cash after your service. Prices may change; the price shown at booking applies to that booking.</p>
<h3>5. First-visit offer</h3><p>The 15% first-visit discount applies to one service for new clients only, cannot be combined with other offers and has no cash value. Code FIRST15 must be claimed when booking.</p>
<h3>6. Children</h3><p>Children under 12 must be accompanied by a parent or guardian for the whole appointment.</p>
<h3>7. Skin, allergies and safety</h3><p>Tell your barber about skin conditions, allergies or sensitivities before your service. We may decline a service where it is unsafe to proceed.</p>
<h3>8. Liability</h3><p>We take reasonable care with every service. We are not liable for loss of personal belongings, or for results that differ from a photo or description you provide, except where the law says otherwise.</p>
<h3 id="privacy">9. Privacy (POPIA)</h3><p>We collect your name, phone number and email only to manage your booking and contact you about it. We do not sell your information. You may ask us to view, correct or delete your details at any time by emailing hello@@crownbarbershop.example.</p>
<h3>10. Changes and contact</h3><p>We may update these terms from time to time; the version on this page applies. Questions? Call 011 555 0142.</p>
</div></div>